{
  "workspace": "dmath",
  "note": "One safe rich-text feature set, asserted against BOTH renderers (browser workbench.js richText and server pages._render_markdown). Heading levels deliberately differ per surface (the browser starts at h1, server pages keep their own h1 title), so heading assertions stay level-agnostic. Raw HTML must never become live markup. {workspace} stands for the owning workspace name, substituted by each test.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "heading",
      "markdown": "### 知识跨度",
      "contains": [
        ">知识跨度</h"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "unordered_list",
      "markdown": "- 第一项\n- 第二项",
      "contains": [
        "<ul>",
        "<li>第一项</li>",
        "<li>第二项</li>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "ordered_list",
      "markdown": "1. 第一步\n2. 第二步",
      "contains": [
        "<ol>",
        "<li>第一步</li>",
        "<li>第二步</li>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "blockquote",
      "markdown": "> 引用行",
      "contains": [
        "<blockquote>引用行</blockquote>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "emphasis",
      "markdown": "**粗体** 与 *斜体* 与 _下划斜体_",
      "contains": [
        "<strong>粗体</strong>",
        "<em>斜体</em>",
        "<em>下划斜体</em>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "inline_code",
      "markdown": "`E = F/q`",
      "contains": [
        "<code>E = F/q</code>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "fenced_code",
      "markdown": "```python\nprint(1)\n```",
      "contains": [
        "<pre><code",
        "print(1)"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "link",
      "markdown": "[教材](https://example.com/phys)",
      "contains": [
        "<a href=",
        "https://example.com/phys",
        ">教材</a>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "image",
      "markdown": "![圆环图](ch12/abc.png)",
      "contains": [
        "<img",
        "/api/w/{workspace}/figures/ch12/abc.png"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "inline_math",
      "markdown": "电荷 $q = 2$ 受力",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>",
        "q = 2"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "display_math",
      "markdown": "$$E = 2k\\lambda / R$$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math display'>",
        "E = 2k"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "inline_math_escapes_once",
      "markdown": "当 $a<b$ 且 $f'(x)$ 时，$a=\"b\"$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>a&lt;b</span>",
        "f&#x27;(x)",
        "a=&quot;b&quot;"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "&amp;lt;",
        "&amp;gt;",
        "&amp;#x27;",
        "&amp;quot;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "display_math_escapes_once",
      "markdown": "$$x < y \\quad \\left| f \\right| > 4$$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math display'>",
        "x &lt; y",
        "&gt; 4"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "&amp;lt;",
        "&amp;gt;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "display_math_spans_lines",
      "markdown": "试证：\n\n$$\n\\exists x _ {0} \\in [ 0, 1 ]\n$$\n\n$$\n\\left| f \\left(x _ {0}\\right) \\right| > 4\n$$\n",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math display'>",
        "\\exists x _ {0} \\in [ 0, 1 ]",
        "\\left| f \\left(x _ {0}\\right) \\right| &gt; 4"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "$$",
        "<em>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "latex_escaped_underscore_is_a_blank",
      "markdown": "则 $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} x_{n} =$ \\_\\_\\_\\_.",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} x_{n} =</span>",
        "____."
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<em>",
        "\\_\\_\\_\\_",
        "<em>\\</em>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "latex_subscripts_survive_emphasis",
      "markdown": "$\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i$ 与 $\\lim _ {n} \\frac {A _ {1}}{n}$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>\\sum_{i=1}^{n} x_i</span>",
        "<span class='math'>\\lim _ {n} \\frac {A _ {1}}{n}</span>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<em>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "emphasis_inside_math_is_untouched",
      "markdown": "$a \\* b$ 与 $a ` b$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>a \\* b</span>",
        "<span class='math'>a ` b</span>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<em>",
        "<code>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "gfm_table",
      "markdown": "| 量 | 单位 |\n| --- | --- |\n| E | N/C |\n| q | C |",
      "contains": [
        "rich-table-wrap",
        "<table",
        "<th>量</th>",
        "<th>单位</th>",
        "<td>E</td>",
        "<td>N/C</td>",
        "<td>q</td>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "| 量 |",
        "| --- |"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "table_cells_keep_inline_rules",
      "markdown": "| 记号 | 说明 |\n| --- | --- |\n| `B` | **磁感**应强度 |",
      "contains": [
        "<code>B</code>",
        "<strong>磁感</strong>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "horizontal_rule_dashes",
      "markdown": "上文\n\n---\n\n下文",
      "contains": [
        "<p>上文</p>",
        "<hr>",
        "<p>下文</p>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<p>---</p>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "horizontal_rule_stars",
      "markdown": "上文\n\n***\n\n下文",
      "contains": [
        "<hr>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<p>***</p>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "horizontal_rule_underscores",
      "markdown": "上文\n\n___\n\n下文",
      "contains": [
        "<hr>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<p>___</p>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "horizontal_rule_inside_code_stays_code",
      "markdown": "```text\n---\n***\n___\n```",
      "contains": [
        "<pre><code",
        "---\n***\n___",
        "</code></pre>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<hr>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "raw_html_is_escaped",
      "markdown": "<script>alert(1)</script> 不安全",
      "contains": [
        "&lt;script&gt;"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<script"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "raw_html_inside_math_stays_text",
      "markdown": "$<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>$",
      "contains": [
        "<span class='math'>&lt;img src=x onerror=alert(1)&gt;</span>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "<img"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "wiki_link_renders_its_label",
      "markdown": "见 [[kp-01|级数展开]] 继续",
      "contains": [
        "<a href='/w/{workspace}/kp/kp-01'>级数展开</a>"
      ],
      "excludes": []
    },
    {
      "name": "wiki_link_id_must_be_an_identifier",
      "markdown": "见 [[../../etc/passwd]] 继续",
      "contains": [
        "../../etc/passwd"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "href='/w/{workspace}/kp/../"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "external_link_keeps_its_query",
      "markdown": "[教材](https://example.com/p?a=1&b=2)",
      "contains": [
        "href='https://example.com/p?a=1&amp;b=2'"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "&amp;amp;"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "image_alt_escapes_once",
      "markdown": "![a<b 图](ch12/abc.png)",
      "contains": [
        "<img alt='a&lt;b 图' src='/api/w/{workspace}/figures/ch12/abc.png'>"
      ],
      "excludes": [
        "&amp;lt;"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
